{"id":"u-2942841a-dd8a-44b9-8fa5-8d0a1ec23290","src":"community","title":"Dumbbells Workout","author":"Fish E.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/kKHYId-untitled-program","desc":"MONDAY & THURSDAY \n\n30-Minute Upper Body & Core Strength Circuit. \nFocus: Muscle building and postural strength. \n\nRULES:\n- Maximum 3 sets per exercise.\n- Increase dumbbell weight with each set (e.g., Set 1: 10kg, Set 2/3: 20kg).\n- Move straight from Exercise A to Exercise B with NO rest (Superset).\n- Rest strictly for 60 seconds after completing each superset.\n\nSUPERSET 1:\nA) Floor Dumbbell Press (8-12 reps) -> Heavy Chest & Arms\nB) Dumbbell Plank Rows (10 reps total) -> Upper Back & Core Bracing\n\nSUPERSET 2:\nA) Dumbbell Shoulder Press (10 reps) -> Overhead Power\nB) Weighted Crunches (15 reps) -> Upper Abs (Use 5kg)\n‐-------\n\nTUESDAY & FRIDAY \n\n30-Minute Lower Body & Core Strength Circuit. \nFocus: Leg power, glute development, and lower ab stability.\n\nRULES:\n- Maximum 3 sets per exercise.\n- Increase dumbbell weight with each set (e.g., Set 1: 10kg, Set 2/3: 20kg).\n- Move straight from Exercise A to Exercise B with NO rest (Superset).\n- Rest strictly for 60 seconds after completing each superset.\n\nSUPERSET 1:\nA) Dumbbell Goblet Squat (10-12 reps) -> Quads & Core Strength\nB) Dumbbell Russian Twists (20 reps total) -> Obliques & Side Abs (Use 5kg)\n\nSUPERSET 2:\nA) Dumbbell Romanian Deadlifts (10 reps) -> Hamstrings & Glutes\nB) Forearm Plank (45-60 second hold) -> Deep Core Endurance (No weight)","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Dumbbell Only"],"minutes":30,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-05T20:16:17.213Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["MONDAY & THURSDAY","Wednesday","TUESDAY & FRIDAY"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Floor Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10}]},{"n":"Dumbbell Plank Rows","sets":[{"r":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Rest","sets":[{"sec":60}]},{"n":"Standing Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10}]},{"n":"Abs